<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>CityRoute.in - Navigate Your City</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      color: #333;
    }
    
    nav {
      background-color: #fff;
      padding: 15px 40px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #e9ecef;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e63946;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #333;
    }   
    
    .flex {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .flex a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #555;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .flex a:hover {
      color: #e63946;
    }

    .flex button {
      background-color: #e63946;
      color: #fff !important;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.2s !important;
    }

    .flex button:hover {
      background-color: #c1121f !important;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e63946 0%, #c1121f 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 80px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
      opacity: 0.9;
      max-width: 550px;
      margin: 0 auto 35px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .search-box {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 30px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }

    .search-box h3 {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .input-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .input-row input {
      padding: 12px 15px;
      border: 1.5px solid #dee2e6;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .input-row input:focus {
      border-color: #e63946;
    }

    .transport-options {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .transport-options label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #555;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .search-btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px;
      background: #e63946;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .search-btn:hover {
      background: #c1121f;
    }

    #result-box {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 15px;
      background: #f1faee;
      border-left: 4px solid #2a9d8f;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .stats-section {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 50px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 60px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .stat-item h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e63946;
    }

    .stat-item p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #777;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .features-section {
      padding: 70px 40px;
      background: #f8f9fa;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #333;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 28px 22px;
      border: 1.5px solid #e9ecef;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      cursor: default;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.09);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #222;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #777;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .cities-section {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 70px 40px;
    }

    .cities-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .city-card {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border: 1.5px solid #e9ecef;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 22px 18px;
      text-align: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .city-card:hover {
      background: #e63946;
      color: #fff;
      border-color: #e63946;
    }

    .city-card:hover .city-name,
    .city-card:hover .city-sub {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .city-card .city-emoji {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .city-name {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #333;
    }

    .city-sub {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .how-section {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 70px 40px;
    }

    .steps-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .step-card {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .step-number {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      background: #e63946;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
    }

    .step-card h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #222;
    }

    .step-card p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #777;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .alerts-section {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 70px 40px;
    }

    .alerts-wrapper {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .alert-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 16px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: padding-left 0.2s;
    }

    .alert-item:hover {
      padding-left: 6px;
    }

    .alert-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .alert-icon {
      font-size: 22px;
      padding-top: 2px;
    }

    .alert-text strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #222;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .alert-text span {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #999;
    }

    .alert-badge {
      margin-left: auto;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .badge-delay  { background: #ffe3e3; color: #e63946; }
    .badge-normal { background: #d3f9d8; color: #2f9e44; }
    .badge-crowd  { background: #e9d8fd; color: #7048e8; }
    .badge-weather{ background: #fff3bf; color: #f08c00; }


    .testimonials-section {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 70px 40px;
    }

    .testimonials-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .testimonial-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1.5px solid #e9ecef;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .testimonial-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-style: italic;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .testimonial-author {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .author-avatar {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #f1f3f5;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .author-name {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #333;
    }

    .author-city {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #999;
    }

    .stars {
      color: #f59f00;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .faq-section {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 70px 40px;
    }

    .faq-wrapper {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .faq-item {
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid #e9ecef;
    }

    .faq-question {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 18px 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #333;
    }

    .faq-question:hover {
      color: #e63946;
    }

    .faq-toggle {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #aaa;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .faq-item.open .faq-toggle {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
      color: #e63946;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.7;
      display: none;
      padding-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .cta-section {
      background: #222;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-section h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .cta-section p {
      font-size: 15px;
      opacity: 0.7;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .cta-btn-primary {
      background: #e63946;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .cta-btn-primary:hover {
      background: #c1121f;
    }

    .cta-btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: #fff;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      padding: 13px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .cta-btn-secondary:hover {
      border-color: #fff;
    }

    footer {
      background: #111;
      color: #ccc;
      padding: 50px 40px 30px;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .footer-brand .logo {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #e63946;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #888;
      max-width: 240px;
    }

    .footer-col h4 {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .footer-col a {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .footer-col a:hover {
      color: #e63946;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
      padding-top: 25px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #555;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav { padding: 15px 20px; }
      .nav-links { display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
      .nav-links.open { display: flex; position: absolute; top: 60px; left: 0; right: 0; background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
      .hamburger { display: block; }

      .hero { padding: 50px 20px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 28px; }

      .stats-grid { gap: 30px; }

      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 400px; }
      .cities-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 400px; }

      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 25px; }
      .features-section, .cities-section, .how-section, .alerts-section,
      .testimonials-section, .faq-section, .cta-section { padding: 50px 20px; }
      footer { padding: 40px 20px 25px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="relative">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-2 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">            
    <div class="relative flex h-16 items-center">
      <div class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-center sm:items-stretch sm:justify-start">
        <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center">
          <a href="#" class="logo">City<span>Route</span>.in</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:ml-6 sm:block">
          <div class="flex">
            <a href="#features" aria-current="page" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm">Features</a>
            <a href="#cities" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm">Cities</a>
            <a href="#how" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm">How It Works</a>
            <a href="#alerts" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm">Live Alerts</a>
            <a href="#" class="rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm"><button>Get App</button></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Navigate Every Street,<br>Every City in India</h1>
  <p>Plan your commute using metro, bus, cab or train — with real-time delays, crowd updates and last-mile routes.</p>

  <div class="search-box">
    <h3>🗺️ Find Your Route</h3>

    <div class="input-row">
      <input type="text" id="fromInput" placeholder="📍 From — Enter your location or landmark" />
      <input type="text" id="toInput" placeholder="🏁 To — Enter destination" />
    </div>

    <div class="transport-options">
      <label><input type="checkbox" value="metro" checked> 🚇 Metro</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" value="bus" checked> 🚌 Bus</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" value="cab"> 🚕 Cab</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" value="train"> 🚆 Train</label>
    </div>

    <button class="search-btn" id="searchBtn">Search Best Route</button>

    <div id="result-box"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-section">
  <div class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <h2>28+</h2>
      <p>Cities Covered</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <h2>2.4L+</h2>
      <p>Daily Commutes Planned</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <h2>98%</h2>
      <p>Route Accuracy</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <h2>4.7★</h2>
      <p>App Rating</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="features-section" id="features">
  <h2 class="section-title">Why CityRoute?</h2>
  <p class="section-subtitle">Built for how India actually commutes — not how apps think it does.</p>

  <div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">🗺️</div>
      <h3>Multimodal Routing</h3>
      <p>Combine metro, bus, auto and walking in a single journey. No more switching between 3 different apps.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
      <h3>Real-Time Delays</h3>
      <p>Live delay data from transit APIs and crowdsourced reports. Know before you leave, not after you miss your bus.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
      <h3>Crowd Density</h3>
      <p>See how packed your metro or bus is right now. Pick the less crowded option and travel comfortably.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
      <h3>Last Mile Help</h3>
      <p>Auto-rickshaw zones, bus bays and e-rickshaw spots all mapped. Because navigation shouldn't stop at the station.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">🌧️</div>
      <h3>Monsoon Mode</h3>
      <p>Heavy rains in Mumbai? CityRoute suggests alternate routes before you step outside. Monsoon-proof planning.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">♿</div>
      <h3>Accessibility Mode</h3>
      <p>Routes filtered for lifts, ramps and accessible transport. Designed for senior citizens and differently-abled commuters.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cities-section" id="cities">
  <h2 class="section-title">Available Cities</h2>
  <p class="section-subtitle">Click on your city to start planning your route.</p>

  <div class="cities-grid">
    <div class="city-card" data-city="Mumbai">
      <div class="city-emoji">🌊</div>
      <div class="city-name">Mumbai</div>
      <div class="city-sub">Local · Metro · BEST Bus</div>
    </div>
    <div class="city-card" data-city="Delhi">
      <div class="city-emoji">🏛️</div>
      <div class="city-name">Delhi NCR</div>
      <div class="city-sub">DMRC · DTC · Rapid Metro</div>
    </div>
    <div class="city-card" data-city="Bengaluru">
      <div class="city-emoji">🌿</div>
      <div class="city-name">Bengaluru</div>
      <div class="city-sub">Namma Metro · BMTC</div>
    </div>
    <div class="city-card" data-city="Hyderabad">
      <div class="city-emoji">💎</div>
      <div class="city-name">Hyderabad</div>
      <div class="city-sub">Metro Rail · TSRTC</div>
    </div>
    <div class="city-card" data-city="Chennai">
      <div class="city-emoji">🎶</div>
      <div class="city-name">Chennai</div>
      <div class="city-sub">Chennai Metro · MTC</div>
    </div>
    <div class="city-card" data-city="Pune">
      <div class="city-emoji">🏍️</div>
      <div class="city-name">Pune</div>
      <div class="city-sub">PMPML · Metro</div>
    </div>
    <div class="city-card" data-city="Ahmedabad">
      <div class="city-emoji">🏗️</div>
      <div class="city-name">Ahmedabad</div>
      <div class="city-sub">Metro · AMTS · BRTS</div>
    </div>
    <div class="city-card" data-city="Kochi">
      <div class="city-emoji">⛵</div>
      <div class="city-name">Kochi</div>
      <div class="city-sub">Metro · Water Metro</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how-section" id="how">
  <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
  <p class="section-subtitle">Four simple steps to a stress-free commute.</p>

  <div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-number">1</div>
      <h3>Enter Journey</h3>
      <p>Type your starting point and destination. Works with landmarks, colony names and station names.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-number">2</div>
      <h3>Pick Transport</h3>
      <p>Choose metro, bus, cab or mixed. Filter by cost, time or comfort — your choice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-number">3</div>
      <h3>Get Live Route</h3>
      <p>See real-time options with ETAs, crowd levels and delay alerts. Updated every 30 seconds.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-number">4</div>
      <h3>Navigate & Go</h3>
      <p>Turn-by-turn navigation with platform numbers, boarding reminders and last-mile directions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alerts-section" id="alerts">
  <h2 class="section-title">🔴 Live Alerts Today</h2>
  <p class="section-subtitle">Real-time disruptions, crowd warnings and weather updates.</p>

  <div class="alerts-wrapper">
    <div class="alert-item">
      <div class="alert-icon">⚠️</div>
      <div class="alert-text">
        <strong>Mumbai Metro Line 1 — Delay at Versova</strong>
        <span>2 min ago · Est. 15 min delay · Try Western Railway instead</span>
      </div>
      <span class="alert-badge badge-delay">Delay</span>
    </div>
    <div class="alert-item">
      <div class="alert-icon">🌧️</div>
      <div class="alert-text">
        <strong>Heavy rain — Outer Ring Road, Bengaluru</strong>
